# Cached blockchain data.
# The cache is a *build artifact* by default: it is regenerated by replaying
# requests, and it grows large. The one exception is a deliberately pinned
# demo snapshot -- if the team commits one, force-add it:
#   git add -f backend/data/cache.sqlite3
backend/data/cache.sqlite3
backend/data/cache.sqlite3-wal
backend/data/cache.sqlite3-shm

# Generated label corpus (rebuild: python scripts/ingest_ofac.py).
# Not committed because it is dated and must be refreshed, and a stale
# sanctions list is worse than an absent one.
backend/data/labels/ofac_sanctions.json

